# Rendered by roles/clabernetes_host. Edits here are overwritten on the next run.
#
# Read at boot by systemd-modules-load.service. modprobe alone does not survive a
# power cycle, and what follows is silent: tc accepts a netem qdisc against a
# kernel with no sch_netem by impairing nothing, so a fault scenario runs to
# completion, the agent correctly diagnoses a healthy network, and the miss is
# scored against the agent rather than against the host.
{% for module in clabernetes_kernel_modules %}
{{ module }}
{% endfor %}
